{
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "projectId": "pilot-sky-blue",
  "language": "en",
  "timingSource": "audio/timing.json",
  "mode": "BOTH",
  "timingLevel": "SEGMENT_TIMING",
  "items": [
    {
      "captionId": "cap-1",
      "startMs": 0,
      "endMs": 6497,
      "text": "Look up on a clear day, and the sky is blue. But sunlight itself is white.",
      "evidence": {
        "source": "audio/timing.json",
        "level": "SEGMENT_TIMING"
      }
    },
    {
      "captionId": "cap-2",
      "startMs": 6497,
      "endMs": 9394,
      "text": "So where does the blue come from?",
      "evidence": {
        "source": "audio/timing.json",
        "level": "SEGMENT_TIMING"
      }
    },
    {
      "captionId": "cap-3",
      "startMs": 9394,
      "endMs": 15554,
      "text": "The answer is written in the air itself. Tiny molecules of nitrogen and oxygen,",
      "evidence": {
        "source": "audio/timing.json",
        "level": "SEGMENT_TIMING"
      }
    },
    {
      "captionId": "cap-4",
      "startMs": 15554,
      "endMs": 18127,
      "text": "far smaller than a wave of light.",
      "evidence": {
        "source": "audio/timing.json",
        "level": "SEGMENT_TIMING"
      }
    },
    {
      "captionId": "cap-5",
      "startMs": 18127,
      "endMs": 23845,
      "text": "When sunlight hits them, they scatter short blue wavelengths in every direction,",
      "evidence": {
        "source": "audio/timing.json",
        "level": "SEGMENT_TIMING"
      }
    },
    {
      "captionId": "cap-6",
      "startMs": 23845,
      "endMs": 26490,
      "text": "several times more strongly than red.",
      "evidence": {
        "source": "audio/timing.json",
        "level": "SEGMENT_TIMING"
      }
    },
    {
      "captionId": "cap-7",
      "startMs": 26490,
      "endMs": 31365,
      "text": "That scattered blue light reaches your eyes from everywhere overhead.",
      "evidence": {
        "source": "audio/timing.json",
        "level": "SEGMENT_TIMING"
      }
    },
    {
      "captionId": "cap-8",
      "startMs": 31365,
      "endMs": 33979,
      "text": "That is why the whole sky glows blue.",
      "evidence": {
        "source": "audio/timing.json",
        "level": "SEGMENT_TIMING"
      }
    },
    {
      "captionId": "cap-9",
      "startMs": 33979,
      "endMs": 38671,
      "text": "Violet is scattered even more, but there is less of it in sunlight,",
      "evidence": {
        "source": "audio/timing.json",
        "level": "SEGMENT_TIMING"
      }
    },
    {
      "captionId": "cap-10",
      "startMs": 38671,
      "endMs": 41402,
      "text": "and your eyes are less sensitive to it.",
      "evidence": {
        "source": "audio/timing.json",
        "level": "SEGMENT_TIMING"
      }
    },
    {
      "captionId": "cap-11",
      "startMs": 41402,
      "endMs": 47378,
      "text": "At sunset, sunlight crosses much more air. The blue is scattered away,",
      "evidence": {
        "source": "audio/timing.json",
        "level": "SEGMENT_TIMING"
      }
    },
    {
      "captionId": "cap-12",
      "startMs": 47378,
      "endMs": 50110,
      "text": "and the reds and oranges remain.",
      "evidence": {
        "source": "audio/timing.json",
        "level": "SEGMENT_TIMING"
      }
    },
    {
      "captionId": "cap-13",
      "startMs": 50110,
      "endMs": 53463,
      "text": "Dust and pollution scatter all colors equally,",
      "evidence": {
        "source": "audio/timing.json",
        "level": "SEGMENT_TIMING"
      }
    },
    {
      "captionId": "cap-14",
      "startMs": 53463,
      "endMs": 56744,
      "text": "which is why a hazy sky looks pale and white.",
      "evidence": {
        "source": "audio/timing.json",
        "level": "SEGMENT_TIMING"
      }
    },
    {
      "captionId": "cap-15",
      "startMs": 56744,
      "endMs": 63424,
      "text": "So the blue sky is not a thing. It is sunlight, rearranged by the air.",
      "evidence": {
        "source": "audio/timing.json",
        "level": "SEGMENT_TIMING"
      }
    },
    {
      "captionId": "cap-16",
      "startMs": 63424,
      "endMs": 65332,
      "text": "Thanks for watching.",
      "evidence": {
        "source": "audio/timing.json",
        "level": "SEGMENT_TIMING"
      }
    }
  ]
}
